Package: layaR
Title: Local Laya Decision Models via Rust
Version: 0.2.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("G. Nono", "Ghislain", , "nonoghislain@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Convai Innovations", role = "cph",
             comment = "laya-onnx Rust crate and the test fixtures derived from its golden tests"),
      person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "cph",
             comment = "see LICENSE.note"))
Description: Run Laya System 1 decision models (typed choice, score and
    yes/no questions with calibrated probabilities) locally from R,
    through the laya-onnx Rust crate and ONNX Runtime. No Python or server
    is required at prediction time.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://gueyenono.github.io/layaR/, https://github.com/gueyenono/layaR
BugReports: https://github.com/gueyenono/layaR/issues
