RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.88.0, xz,
    ONNX Runtime >= 1.27 (downloaded on first use by
    laya_install_runtime())
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
